e gate.\r\n\r\nSDL is C, which is generally much faster than compile than C++ (especially modern C++). I've seen comparisons where the same SLOC count compiles ~5 times faster in C than modern C++.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3433021081/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3433034937","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110013#issuecomment-3433034937","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110013","id":3433034937,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Mn_S5","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-22T15:33:30Z","updated_at":"2025-10-22T15:35:44Z","body":"This fails to build on Linux on my end, with Python 3.13.7 and SCons 4.9.1:\r\n\r\n```\r\nNameError: name 'print_warning' is not defined:\r\n  File \"/home/hugo/Documents/Git/godotengine/godot-3.x/SConstruct\", line 468:\r\n    detect.configure(env)\r\n  File \"/home/hugo/Documents/Git/godotengine/godot-3.x/platform/x11/detect.py\", line 388:\r\n    print_warning(\"D-Bus development libraries not found. Disabling screensaver prevention.\")\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe code for `print_warning()`, `print_error()` and `print_info()` is new in 4.x (and has been reworked numerous times in PRs like https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101322).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3433034937/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3435699491","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110013#issuecomment-3435699491","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110013","id":3435699491,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7MyJ0j","user":{"login":"kilian-diener","id":58468519,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NDY4NTE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58468519?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener","html_url":"https://github.com/kilian-diener","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_a